"<em>Folder-&gt;Properties...</em> dialog? You can then use\n"
"<em>Message-&gt;New&nbsp;Message&nbsp;to&nbsp;Mailing&nbsp;List...</em>\n"
"to open the composer with the mailing list address preset.\n"
